# Everglade II's instance cull for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS | rw | atomic]), as coax/web/host.js lays them out
# (its header's "Instance culling"): one group, each entry using its own part of it.
u 0 0 uniform 25
inst 0 1 rw
runs 0 2
boxes 0 3
args 0 4 atomic
flags 0 5 rw
tally 0 6 atomic
hiz 0 7 rw
depth 0 8
hz 0 9 uniform 1
buckets 0 10
indices 0 11
vertices 0 12
bounds 0 13 atomic
